  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1180/499/tavox-title-png.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">首次展示。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">感谢我的朋友兼共同作者Leon。请到Youtube观看他的精彩影片。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MR68YK--0PY?t=159s\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">过时的展示</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe style=\"width:180px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BFpgBwoWEVw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> &nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe style=\"width:180px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoiH0xyXWEA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y6x8qjo4KTM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:180px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y6x8qjo4KTM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">概述：</span></strong></p><p>海洋村民是一个Minecraft Fabric和Forge模组，旨在添加带有居民的船只。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/870/794/taxov.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>灾厄战舰：</strong></span></p><p>添加了巨型灾厄海盗王船——一个类似地牢的结构，具有多层、许多详细房间和散落的战利品。最后，玩家将找到一个大型战利品奖励房间。&nbsp;新的灾厄海盗首领一个强大的新灾厄首领，拥有高生命值和伤害，位于船的顶部。预计会有一场具有挑战性的战斗。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1105/547/taxov-21-png.png\" alt=\"taxov.21.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>物品和工具：</strong></span></p><p>海军和海盗装备以及两张带有独特音乐的唱片。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/870/777/taxov.png\" alt=\"截图缩略图\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">海军：</span></strong></p><p>一名船长和一名水手，带有自定义交易。这些船只在海洋生物群系中自然生成。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/870/772/taxov.png\" alt=\"截图缩略图\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">海盗：</span></strong></p><p>一名海盗和他的船员。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/870/773/taxov.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">变种：</span></strong></p><p>海军和海盗船的僵尸化版本。居民被僵尸化并且危险。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/870/796/taxov.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">女巫：</span></strong></p><p>一艘带有女巫的女巫船。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/870/797/taxov.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">物品：</span></strong></p><p>用于生成船只的创造模式物品。海军和海盗装备以及独特音乐。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/870/798/taxov.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>额外内容：</strong></span></p><p>包含自定义画作。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/72/taxov.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>整合：</strong></span></p><p>内置与Recruits模组的兼容性。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/874/366/taxov.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">整合：</span></strong></p><p>内置与Fresh Animations的兼容性。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/885/339/taxov.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">合作：</span></strong></p><p>此模组是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/castaway-island-survival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Castaway</a>模组包的一部分，由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/apotheotic_studios/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheotic Studios</a>制作</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/castaway-island-survival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1166/977/taxov-21-png.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">信息：</span></strong></p><p>此模组灵感来自Ercerus的数据包Ships Out Of The Ocean。&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fships-out-on-the-oceans%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/797/taxov.png\" alt=\"截图缩略图\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">合作：</span></strong></p><p>这项工作是在我的朋友Leon的帮助下完成的。请查看他的模组。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ocean-villager-trader\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/871/888/taxov.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>权限：</strong></span></p><p>允许并欢迎您在自己的模组包中使用此模组。&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/871/889/taxov.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">报告：</span></strong></p><p>请在问题标签中报告所有错误和问题。</p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/taxoceanvillager/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/873/5/taxov.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>致谢：</span></strong></p><p>由Taknax和LeonX编写。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/taknax/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1172/468/taknax-title-png.png\"></a></p>",
